WEBVTT

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.300
Oh, not shrinking back at all, eh?

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.040
How were you sure it wasn't poison?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.340
Even if its purpose was only to threaten,

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:08.080
one wouldn't use something that sprays this much next to the person they're protecting.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.770
You can't do that!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.910
I need to deliver these goods by tomorrow, or I'll be fired!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.310
No is no!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.420
I'm not letting you through no matter what you say!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:36.330
Damn, why do we cops have to help the army with checkpoints?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.420
Stop complaining.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.330
They are from Fourth Axe.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:43.930
Each and every one of them hold special authority, apparently.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.800
As long as they are under the pretext of "information control",

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.680
they can even give orders to
lower-ranked members of other organizations.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.560
Man, that sounds pretty wicked.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.070
Ah, sorry.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.170
This area is being blocked up.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.080
Could you take a detour?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.610
They're okay.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.420
Let that car get through.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.060
Huh?

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:12.180
Is there some important person from the army in that car?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.100
Yeah.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.410
Higher-ups.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.630
Our infiltration of Section I is still incomplete,

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.230
yet that youngster...

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:25.950
...isn't he just enjoying being in danger?

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:32.270
They say baby lions learn how to hunt by "playing" with their siblings.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.210
From their play, they not only learn the necessary skills,

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:40.960
but also a pseudo-experience of killing and losing their lives...

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.540
...and through that, learn the ethics of life.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:50.370
And thus, lions will never do unnecessary hunting.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.590
But that youngster...

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.060
He didn't have any.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:58.420
He didn't have any siblings equal enough to play with him.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.700
He grew up with fangs and claws that didn't learn the ethics of life...

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.550
...with no opponent to play with.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.620
Hey.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.770
Is she going to be okay fighting against him?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.770
If something were to happen, it'll just be up to us to barge in.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:22.780
God, this has become a tricky situation.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.110
Damn, whether it's the big guy...

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.470
...or the LT...

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.010
It smells pretty bad, right?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:42.450
There's an uncultivated marshland in the southern parts of Loderia.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.430
This is the mud from there.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.020
In the marshlands where even surviving is tough,

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.560
amidst the smell of the mud where rotten grass has melted,

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.380
I kept on fighting.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.560
It was a hell where there were no exits, no matter which way you looked.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:10.290
This smell lets me recall that green hell,

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.040
and this mud...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.370
...creates my territory.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.000
No matter how large the mob is,

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:23.260
inside my territory, I can treat them all as weeds in the marshland.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.010
And the weeds...

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.090
...I'll just cut them down with this machete!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:44.330
You're really a scaredy-cat, aren't you, soldier?

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.870
Just hearing that sound makes my feet tremble...

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:50.880
What should I do?

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.300
Blocked?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.080
Neither his breathing nor his heart shows any signs of irregularity.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.450
His eyes...

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:29.260
They don't see the edge of the sword as a "dangerous weapon"...

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.080
...but simply as "something to be dodged".

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:36.160
It's as if he's looking calmly at weeds.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:39.020
What's this?!

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.130
I see...

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.350
Is this what you meant by territory?

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.420
Don't be confused!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.000
This is an illusion!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.430
I'm standing firmly on the floor of the ballroom hall.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.820
It's tough, isn't it?

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.890
When the scenery you see doesn't fit with the smell you breathe in.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:06.560
But...

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.300
I'm used to it.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.110
It appears I have the territorial advantage.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.500
Oh no!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.510
I can't dodge his slash if he has sealed my movements.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:58.940
You're not going to get angry?

00:07:58.940 --> 00:07:59.880
No.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:05.080
Besides, that dress will hinder her in what she's trying to accomplish right now.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.700
She's a girl that cherishes those things...

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.080
...I know that.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:14.970
Oreld.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.510
This can't go on...

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:17.360
You idiot.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.020
If we soldiers take action now,

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:21.060
that'll start the riot again.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.140
Oh shit!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.300
We were paying too much attention to the duel!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.360
No, don't kill him!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.820
Die, Paul!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.650
What's going on... here?

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:14.110
What are you guys... doing?

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.510
Hey, soldier.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.650
What? That woman's still alive?

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:23.370
She's doing quite a job, ain't she?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.130
Ow-wwww...

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.230
Why did you save me?

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.150
Didn't you want to defeat me?

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.240
Forgive me.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.390
I was too caught up in my battle.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.890
What do you guys think you're doing in the middle of the duel?!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.980
You think we can just sit around and wait for this duel?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.230
Even if you'd won and had Paul surrender himself,

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.490
he'll just use his money and power and get out fast!

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.690
Yeah... he's right...

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:59.270
And then, we'll just end with death sentences again!

00:09:59.270 --> 00:10:00.260
Damn it!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:03.800
Then we should take as many of these people as we can with us to hell-

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:11.870
Hmph.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.670
Duel my ass.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:18.610
Does she think her little act will pacify the riot?

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.420
What a naive little girl.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.470
No...

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.760
The 2nd Lieutenant isn't wrong...

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:31.130
She can't be wrong... The 2nd Lieutenant...

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.510
She's different from me...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.740
But if we make mincemeat out of a noble of the Thirteen Families,

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:43.240
then it'll make it easier for us to keep the mob in check.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.550
2nd Lieutenant...

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.960
No matter what kind of situation she faces...

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.410
No matter what kind of enemy she faces...

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.400
She's always standing elegantly...

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.560
I may not be able to protect your lives.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.220
...and straight...

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.650
2nd Lieutenant...

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.280
Am I stupid?

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.630
Was I trying to lean on...

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:36.380
...her small body with my own huge body?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:41.750
To protect their people,
nobles must fight against foreign enemies.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.130
And...

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:47.260
...To discipline their people, sometimes...

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.470
She stabbed...

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:57.140
She stabbed my hand!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.060
Damn it...

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:02.350
...they must fight the very people they protect.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.620
That's right.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.920
There's no way nobles will take the commoners' side.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.000
I was an idiot to even have had a bit of faith in you.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:20.300
I am on nobody's side.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.820
Changing your attitude all of sudden, eh?!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.520
I'll kill you before you killing Paul!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:30.280
Hey, hey, gimme a break.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.020
They're coming to an end inside.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:38.570
I'd much rather smash female meat than male meat.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.200
It's not working.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:45.500
Oreld!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.740
This is the limit.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.570
We're going in.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.910
Stop it!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.400
What? From all I've been hearing,

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.840
you've called us "nobles, nobles" as if we're some kind of bug.

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:57.630
Nobles have families they cherish, as well.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.190
They have people they love.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.210
You think killing us is justice?!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:07.250
You think you can do anything you want because you're all unfortunate commoners?!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:11.900
Aren't you guys the ones who're doing whatever you want by using your social status?

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.110
Machs!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.090
In the worst case, you go in and get the LT out.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:18.990
Okay.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:19.950
All right.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:20.840
Wait.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.980
Please give her just a bit more time.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:25.330
You're...

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.270
No, you're...

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.950
The LT's sister?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:32.110
You are her colleagues, right?

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:35.200
Then, please keep watching for a bit longer.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.900
She's really putting a lot of effort into this.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.330
But...

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.150
No, Lady, you're in danger, as well.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.360
You can't speak for her either.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.100
See?

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.760
Hey, woman!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.680
Are you trying to run away by yourself?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.980
You coward!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.120
Ever since I became the wife of a soldier,

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:02.480
my husband and I have been prepared to mourn each other's death.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:06.520
Don't think I am the same as you people,
banding together and intoxicating yourselves in violence!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:09.740
Damn it...

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.560
Sister, please step aside.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.120
I am in the middle of a duel.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.730
Why?!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:21.790
Why do you insist on going through with this duel?!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.790
Why?!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:28.260
If killing is my only skill, then so be it.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.790
If I'll keep having nightmares, I don't care.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:34.890
I...

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:38.900
I'll use everything I have to protect the 2nd Lieutenant.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.170
That must be...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.240
...how this huge body should be used.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:50.670
That's because...

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.580
...I cannot allow this unfairness.

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.660
"They cannot be punished because they are nobles."

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.590
"They are allowed to do so because they are commoners."

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:00.570
That's ridiculous!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.580
If you are guilty, then you will be punished.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.030
If you do evil, then I will slash you,

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:06.750
whether you are a noble or a commoner,

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:09.850
or even His Majesty, the Emperor...

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:13.730
...that is the only justice I can show.

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.340
His Majesty?!

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.550
This is impiety!

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:19.390
No, this is a great treason!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.450
What's the meaning of this?

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:23.860
What exactly are you?!

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.710
I see...

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:29.150
She's what I was saying she was all this time...

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.580
...a noble...

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.100
Don't push yourself too much,

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.860
you cowardly soldier.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:47.130
H-Hey, how did you suddenly-

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:02.990
W-Wow...

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:05.190
Guns are pretty...

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.940
...scary... eh?

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.360
What the hell is going on?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.280
What the hell are you?!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:18.450
Stay back!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.790
Don't get near me!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.350
Damn, I've had it.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:28.790
I'm not playing this game anymore.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.000
Oh.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.110
The gunshots made them-

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.480
S-Stop doing stupid things!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.390
You've got to be kidding me.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.610
Damn you!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.690
Let go of me!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.200
Let go, you-

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:19.680
To show fairness,

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.060
she cannot take any sides.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:25.140
And thus, if you're a noble or a commoner,

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.350
or whether you're her family, friends,

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.360
or people she must protect,

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.530
no one must take her side.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.160
The more she is a noble, the more lonely she becomes.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:41.380
"If you're a noble or a commoner," eh?

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:45.810
Then, where do soldiers fall in this case?

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:50.950
Perhaps we're not doing an act of justice...

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.010
But...

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.280
Our feelings cannot be laid to rest!

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:59.560
We came in believing that if we came here and killed nobles,

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.930
we could satisfy our feelings!

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.740
What's the matter with you?!

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:42.450
A royal guard from Loderia shouldn't show such disgrace in front of a mob!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.910
She's not someone that will ask for protection.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.950
The more painful it is for her,
the more she only shows her back to others.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:03.410
That's why...

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:14.990
Stay back.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.250
I don't want to say this to you.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:23.330
To you, a person that doesn't want to fight yet gets himself all bloody.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.610
Don't come any closer.

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:27.930
We're in the middle of a duel.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:36.870
I said, stay back.

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.400
Why are you...

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.980
I am a noble.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:49.130
I am a noble, and that's why I must be... in solitude...

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:51.910
2nd Lieutenant.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.420
I also have something that I must accomplish by myself.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:01.520
If that means you're going to be a noble, then I can't do anything.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:10.220
Alice L. Malvin and Randel Oland might remain in solitude forever...

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:15.060
But, the person I met wasn't a noble,

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.610
and perhaps not even a soldier;

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.190
it was the 2nd Lieutenant of Pumpkin Scissors that I met.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.410
That's why I want to protect you, Lieutenant.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:29.250
Because I'm a corporal of Pumpkin Scissors.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.800
C-Corporal.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.800
Yes, Lieutenant.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.180
Gosh.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.360
To have to be a 2nd Lieutenant above being a noble...

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:49.520
Very well, Corporal.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.460
Take off your clothes.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:54.190
Oh, welcome back.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.270
Don't move away by yourself.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.800
You're not in a good mood.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:58.970
Well obviously.

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:03.500
She's all flirty now after ripping apart my dress.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.080
Machs!

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.030
Turn the engine off and get out of the car.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:13.660
Show them that we will not turn our backs to our enemies and run away.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:14.540
Yes, sir!

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.380
And, Oreld!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.550
If you have time to flirt with a married woman,

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:22.220
then protect Marquis Paul! With your life!

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.050
Y-Yes, sir!

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.650
Corporal, you have my back.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.300
Do not let anyone interfere with my duel!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:30.260
Yes, 2nd Lieutenant!

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.050
This coat...

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.810
...has the smell of Section III.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.550
The territory you spoke of...

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:42.270
I have one now, too!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.110
From this moment on...

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.120
...this place is the operational area...

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:57.530
...of the war relief unit, Pumpkin Scissors!

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.220
Mer-kun, now it's time to counterattack!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:35.910
This place is now Section III's operational area.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:38.010
Take on this unhesitant sword!

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:40.780
